Native DERP YAML receiver compatibility

Copyright (c) 2011-2019 Canonical Ltd

The private DERP YAML receiver follows selected gopkg.in/yaml.v3 v3.0.1
resolve.go/decode.go scalar, duplicate-key and merge assignment behavior.
Its parser remains the existing safe Rust granit-parser exposed by
serde-saphyr. This is a finite DERP schema adaptation, not a replacement
for the Go parser or the shared CLI YAML facade.

The original yaml.v3 combined license text is retained in LICENSE-YAML-V3.
The selected source files carry Apache-2.0; the original MIT-covered scanner
port terms are also preserved in that upstream license text. Source pins,
implementation scope and unqualified boundaries are in UPSTREAM.md.
